      "documentation": "Java method: resyncOverlay",
      "javadoc_description": "Re-pushes all markers onto the viewer's shared `AbstractBigViewer.AnnotationOverlay`. A no-op in SNT-UI mode (`viewer == null`). Meant to be called by `Bvv`/`Bdv` right after (re)creating that overlay, so markers added while `syncViewerOverlay()` was still no-op-ing on a null `AbstractBigViewer.annotations()` (i.e. before the viewer window existed) get rendered instead of silently staying buffered in the model.",
